      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isarela himuvinyu wafwankila, wasoŋaŋa nyikabu yindi. Mwavulila nyikabu yindi, dimu nawa mwanavulishiliyi tumeŋa twindi; mwafukila ituŋa dindi, dimu nawa mwanasoŋeliyi tuposhi twindi twakupeshela twalubanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchima wawu wunaambuki mukachi, ichi dinu anayimoni anatanyi; yena wakahumona tumeŋa twawu, wakakisaŋana tuposhi twawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ichi dinu chalala akahosha nawu, Hitukweti mwantaku; muloŋa hitwamutiya Yehova womaku; ochu mwanta wakeŋa a kutwililadi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adi nakuhosha kwamazu hohu, nakusanyika mwakutwamba hatiyaloŋanaŋawu yitiyaŋenu; dihu hakufuma kusompesha hikukumenamena neyi wululu wamwajaŋoŋu chiwamenaŋa munyondoŋolu yamwiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akwakushakama muSamariya akafwa mutentu wanyana kaŋombi akuBetaveni; muloŋa antu amukishi owu, niayikombeji amutiyilaŋa kuwaha, akamudila hansaŋu yakulema kwindi kunamufumi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamutwala kuAshuri, akamuhani kudi mwanta Yarebi yahimulambu; aEfweremi akayitiyisha nsonyi, niaIsarela akatiya nsonyi yampùŋa yawu yatiyaŋenuwu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila Samariya, mwanta wawu anamufumishuhu, neyi mafulolu ahameji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yinaŋanaŋa yakuAveni, diyi nshidi yawaIsarela, akayikisaŋana. Ninyiŋa ninyisonsonyi yakamena hatumena twawu; akayila mapidi amaneni nawu, Tubutenu; nimpidi janyanya nawu, Tuholokelenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu aIsarela, kufumisha kumafuku aGibeya saŋa muvulumwina hohu. Kwenoku emeni; alondeli njita yakwasawu akwakuheŋa yakabuli kuyiwana muGibeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakayeta hinakakeŋela; chakayikasilawu kunyiloŋa yawu yiyedi nyuza yawantu yakayipompela nandombu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efweremi wadiŋi iyoŋa daŋombi wamukaji wadiza dehi, wakeŋa elaŋa kudatola tidiku; ami naanakeneni nshiŋu yindi yasweja lubanji. Ichi dinu nukumusha hadi Efweremi mukwakwendelahu; Yuda wakadima, Yakoba wakahumona makenkindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ditumbilenu kuloŋa, mwakaaŋuli luwi; chipululenu mashindi enu; muloŋa diyi mpinji yakumukeŋakeŋa Yehova, nichakenzayi yena nakuyinokeshela nvula yakuloŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu munadimi kutama, munaaŋuli kuheŋa; munadyi nyikabu yakutwamba kumwatwambatwambaŋa; muloŋa mwakuhweleleli njila yenu, niizaza dawayilobu jenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi hakachi kamuza weyi hakavwakuka muyoyu, ninyikala yeyi yayipaka akayipupa yejima, neyi chapupiluwu Betarabeli kudi Shalimani mwifuku danjita. Amama jawantu ayichikili puchi puchi hamu nawanyanawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi chakayikoŋawu enu kudi Beteli namuloŋa wakutama kwenu kwasweja. Kukucha mwanta wawaIsarela akamufumishahu chikupu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
